\n在下匈奴单于之子刘渊，特来向敌人大将\n讨教。\n&夏侯霸\n匈奴人居然会如此知书达礼？"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["虫珼矪竚"]},"end":52},{"op":104,"name":"duel_setup","args":[7,557,20]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[1,"我就试试看你有多少斤两…",9]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[0,"请！",8]},{"op":97,"name":"duel_end","args":[]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,8]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[0,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[0,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,4,0]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,4]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,3]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,2,0]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,4,0]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,2,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,2,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,4,0]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,4]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,2,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,4,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,4]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,2,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,2,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,4]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[0,2,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,12]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"好强…天下果然充满着未知\n的强者。",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,12]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"年纪轻轻就有这样的实力，\n日后一定是不可限量。",1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":95,"name":"duel_start","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘渊\n若不是将军您手下留情，只怕刘渊早成为\n您刀下亡魂。\n&夏侯霸\n你和我所认知的匈奴人差很多。\n&刘渊\n早在数年前我就被送到洛阳来当质子，\n接触中原的衣冠文物也算有点时间。\n&夏侯霸\n原来如此。我想你这次出兵，应该不全是\n为了司马家吧。\n&夏侯霸\n逃离司马家的掌控，回复自由之身才是你\n真正的考量。\n&刘渊\n不错，虽说身为质子，我早有被杀的觉悟\n。但在功成名就以前就死，还是感到很不\n甘心。\n&夏侯霸\n你愿意归顺我军吗？\n&刘渊\n那么请先打败我，如此我就回报了司马家\n对我的恩情。\n&夏侯霸\n原来如此，你真的不简单呀。"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[43,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":14,"offset":20532,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[23,119,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[45]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[23,119,0,0,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[119,23,0,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&胡奋\n继上次子午谷之后又有一个女将，蜀人\n难道真的没人了？\n&张星彩\n那么上次你打赢了？\n&胡奋\n………"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},"end":73},{"op":104,"name":"duel_setup","args":[23,119,20]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[1,"既然没有打赢，就不要随便小\n看女人。",10]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[0,"上次是意外，这次你们可没\n这么好运！",9]},{"op":97,"name":"duel_end","args":[]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,2,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"百贰拾七式 八锖！",1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[0,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,2,0]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,4,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[0,0,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,4,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,3]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,4]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,2,0]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,0,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,2,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[0,0,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,2,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,4,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[0,1,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"禁千贰百拾壹式 八稚女！",1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[0,1,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,12]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"差点就没命了…等一下…为什么\n是这样的东西保护我？",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"你受死吧！",1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,4,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,2,0]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"打够了没？！星彩无残！",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,2]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,0]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,0]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,12]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"蜀人为什么老出一些怪力女？\n（比起来，我的芳儿真是温\n柔贤淑。）",1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[6]},{"op":95,"name":"duel_start","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[1044]]},"end":76},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,119,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张星彩\n这是关索给的护身符…\n&张星彩\n难道我和他的孽缘还是没这么容易切断？"]},{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[102,0,1,23]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[45,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":15,"offset":21977,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[27,57,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[46]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[27,57,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[57,27,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&马岱\n庞会，你知道这里是哪里？\n&庞会\n并州。\n&马岱\n没错，过去我也和令明在这里并肩作战\n，最后大获全胜，击斩郭援。\n&庞会\n这些事情我听过，父亲当时能够名扬天下\n，靠的就是这场战役。\n&马岱\n只是我真的没想到，居然会在这里要和\n令明的儿子交战。\n&庞会\n如果你不妨碍我复仇，这一切都不会\n发生。\n&马岱\n我有义务要阻止你沉沦下去，为了复仇\n看看你变成什么样子？\n&马岱\n就算令明后来投效曹操，但是他的所作\n所为都是那样坦荡，只是尽己所能来为\n自己主公奋战。\n&马岱\n而你呢？为了复仇什么丑事都做尽，现在\n居然没用到去破坏关家的故乡。\n&庞会\n那又如何？为了复仇，我可以当司马家的\n狗，甚至当钟会的狗都无所谓。\n&庞会\n我所要的只有能够帮我复仇的力量而已，\n就算世人将我贬低到极点我都甘之如饴。\n&马岱\n够了，我一定要阻止你继续错下去。\n&庞会\n你能够阻止就来吧，这世上没有人可以\n阻止我的复仇，哪怕是关羽出现在我面\n前，我也会毫不犹豫迎上前去。\n&马岱\n庞会，你这是何苦？"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[46,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":16,"offset":22910,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[7,57,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[48]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[7,57,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[57,7,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯霸\n收手吧，现在的你就和过去的我没有两样\n，只是为了复仇而活的行尸走肉。\n&庞会\n就算如此，我也要复仇。\n&庞会\n我不像你，只因为司马家取得政权就\n逃到父仇的敌人那边，把身为子女该\n做的事情都忘得一干二净。\n&夏侯霸\n因为我还是知道，真正的敌人是篡夺\n大魏的司马家。\n&庞会\n对我来说，大魏或大晋都没有差别，\n谁可以帮我报父仇，谁就是我的主子。\n&夏侯霸\n真是可悲呀，然而除了你自己觉悟以外，\n没有人可以帮你。\n&庞会\n哼！养出像你这样的叛徒，夏侯妙才将军\n在天之灵可是会哭泣的。\n&夏侯霸\n我才不认为庞令明希望看见自己的儿子\n变成这样。"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[48,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":17,"offset":23531,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[111,137,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[47]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[111,137,65535,0,0,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[137,111,65535,0,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&卫瓘\n我就知道你会成为大晋的叛徒，你们\n京兆杜家终究是被清议贬低的一门。\n&杜预\n如果面对自己故乡被毁还不挺身反抗，\n那才是可悲的懦夫。\n&卫瓘\n哼！枉费文皇帝如此看重你，你却这样\n回报他。\n&杜预\n伯玉，你我应该都一样，受过曹家的恩惠\n不比司马家少，你有什么理由只对司马家\n效忠？\n&卫瓘\n你说这样的话还真是不负责任，请问\n我能做什么？像王经那样当烈士？落得\n满门抄斩再向自己母亲道歉？\n&杜预\n终究你还是和过去的我一样，面对权力\n只有屈服，宁可压抑自己的良心也要求\n苟活。\n&卫瓘\n人在朝堂本来就身不由己，这些事情\n你本来就该明白。\n&杜预\n你不觉得这是狡猾的逃避理由？到了后世\n，人们只会尊崇王经这样的烈士，不会管\n你是因为什么理由而对司马家屈膝。\n&卫瓘\n（这些我也知道，甚至我在司马家底下也\n不安全呀。但我能做什么？什么也不能，\n只好随波逐流，不是吗？）"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[47,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":18,"offset":24365,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[119,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[139]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&胡奋\n终究我们安定胡家只能被当武将对待，\n不管怎么努力都无法往上爬，真是可悲\n又可叹。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,119,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[139,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":19,"offset":24549,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[57,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[54]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&庞会\n复仇的怒火永不熄灭，只要我活着一天，\n关家人就永远不得好死！"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,57,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[54,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":20,"offset":24722,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[111,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[80]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&杜预\n大意了，没想到大晋还能有这样的\n力量。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,111,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[80,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":21,"offset":24865,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[137,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[81]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&卫瓘\n我的军队居然被蜀人这样摧残，\n这怎么可能？\n&卫瓘\n这一切都是幻觉，骗不了我的。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,137,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[81,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":22,"offset":25047,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[7,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[153]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯霸\n暂且撤退，留住性命以成就大业。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,7,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[153,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":23,"offset":25185,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[16,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[71]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关索\n比起战败，我更怕这些女人找我算帐。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,16,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[71,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":24,"offset":25325,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[12,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[79]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&宗预\n果然我还是不适合在前线冲锋。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,12,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[79,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":25,"offset":25459,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[20,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[205]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&花鬘\n我可不是因为帮你才弄到撤退的啦。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,20,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[205,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":26,"offset":25597,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[9,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[93]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&袁綝\n不管是袁本初还是陈叔至之子，\n我袁綝都能抬头挺胸面对一切。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,9,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[93,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":27,"offset":25760,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[27,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[92]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&马岱\n西凉骑兵队不能在这个地方被消耗掉。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,27,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[92,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":28,"offset":25900,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[153,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[55]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[